meta {
  name: 06 Revoke Device
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

delete {
  url: {{base_url}}/auth/devices/{{device_id}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
}

docs {
  # 06 Revoke Device — Remove a Trusted Device

  Revokes all active refresh tokens for the specified device,
  preventing it from authenticating again.

  ## Response
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "message": "Device revoked successfully"
    }
  }

  ## Rules
  - Cannot revoke the current device → 403 CANNOT_REMOVE_CURRENT_DEVICE
  - Device must belong to the authenticated user
  - Revoked devices cannot re-authenticate via challenge
  
  Set {{device_id}} to a non-current device ID from step 05.
}
